#version 450

// The D3D12 renderer's tessellation emulation (ShaderRecompiler::IR::TessEmulation): the converted-function tessellator, one invocation per
// patch. A port of the hardware part (CHWTessellator) of Microsoft's D3D11 reference tessellator, as Mesa carries it
// (src/gallium/auxiliary/tessellator/tessellator.cpp), for triangle and quad domains, integer, pow2, fractional odd and fractional even
// spacing, and clockwise or counterclockwise triangles. Same converted point arithmetic, so the same points and triangles.
//
